# Real inventories contain host IPs and credentials — never commit them.
# Tracked exceptions: the *.example.ini templates (placeholder addresses) and
# the ci-*.ini fixtures, which name Docker containers and carry no addresses or
# credentials at all. Without that second exception a newly added CI inventory
# is silently skipped by `git add -A` and the workflow referencing it fails.
inventory/*.ini
!inventory/*.example.ini
!inventory/ci.ini
!inventory/ci-*.ini

# Ansible runtime artifacts
*.retry

# Native-auth JWKS key sets fetched to the control node (spur_auth_keys_dir).
# These files ARE the cluster's auth secrets (auth.jwks is a shared HMAC key) —
# never commit them.
keys/
